Z||000000||88formula||06-17-2001||12:37 AM||||ARP head studs.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ARP_head_studs_1.jpg"> <BR>Here is a picture of the damper mark that supposed to indicate TDC and line up with the timing cover mark. It's way off. I had to locate TDC and cut a new mark. This is a New GM Damper too!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Cut_new_mark.jpg">  Can you imagine what it would have been like to time this engine if I had not checked this?<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
